  message: "Dogfood enrichment (member F159.A3-a) — root-upstream-of-linker-FPs facet, reproduces on the frozen substrate. django (node-level meta.framework) and fastapi (edge-level meta.server_framework) framework evidence is present in the graph but is OMITTED from profile.frameworks (which lists only [lit, starlette]). Concretely: node meta.framework counts {emitter:10, django:4, starlette:8}; edge meta.server_framework {fastapi:6, starlette:6}. So django and fastapi carry framework evidence yet never appear in profile.frameworks — the converse of this row's \"frameworks have no node-level provenance\" gap: here node/edge framework labels exist with no path up to profile.frameworks, and they are themselves partly false positives (django FP via WI-pitit over-broad .connect regex; fastapi FP via WI-fizir dep-blind server_framework). This is the root upstream that makes the linker framework FPs (U18/U20) consumer-visible without a reconciling provenance link. Cross-ref WI-pitit (U18), WI-fizir (U20), WI-babun (two-surface contradiction)."  # e624
