  message: "Dogfood enrichment (member F159.A3-b) — the converse direction, reproduces on the frozen substrate. \"lit\" appears in profile.frameworks with ZERO node/edge framework evidence (0 nodes with meta.framework=lit, 0 edges) — lit is a TS/JS lib and JS/TS symbol extraction is broken (the WI-zavad gap), so the manifest-derived framework has no graph support. So profile.frameworks and the per-node/edge framework meta disagree in BOTH directions: django/fastapi carry evidence but are absent from profile (E03/F159.A3-a), while lit is in profile with no evidence (this facet). Folds onto WI-napuj (no node-level link/provenance for declared frameworks) and onto WI-zavad (the broken JS/TS extraction that leaves lit's frameworks unsupported in the graph). Cross-ref WI-napuj, WI-zavad."  # 6f5d
